        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d80843a-66d4-4d46-a914-08f96773e2fd).Image",
        "Description": "47, thank god you&apos;re alive! Shepherd - real name Reece Faulkner - betrayed us. He created a sick plot together with Hannan to plot the Berlin massacre, and start a world war in which he could finally avenge his lost soldiers. If we don&apos;t kill him and recover the evidence of the foul-play, his truth will become written, and ours will be lost. He will be a hero, and we will be terrorsits.\rHannan told me Reece uses Site Hotel Bravo, in Colorado. We will kill him, and all else involved in his plot.",
